{"case_id": "singapore_male_19930408_P004-Q19", "domain": "relationship", "question": "命主感情状况为何？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，日主为己土，生于辰月，土旺得令，且月时两透丙火正印，日支未土为比肩，整体身强。感情方面主要看财星（妻星）与日支夫妻宫。\n\n- 年柱癸酉，癸水为偏财（男命偏财代表情人或短暂缘分），坐酉金食神，食神生财，但偏财透于年干，且远离日主，暗示早期感情多不稳定、短暂。\n- 月柱丙辰，丙火正印透出，印星过旺会克制食伤（食伤为生财之源），且印星代表长辈、责任，可能压制感情的自由发展。\n- 日支未土为比肩，夫妻宫坐比肩，主配偶易被竞争或自身固执影响，且未土与月支辰土相破，夫妻宫受破，感情易有波折。\n- 时柱丙子，子水为偏财，与日支未土相害（子未害），时柱代表晚运，但子水被丙火盖头，财星受制，且子未害直接冲击夫妻宫，暗示婚姻宫不稳，易有矛盾或分离。\n\n综合来看，命主身强，财星（妻星）偏弱且受制，夫妻宫逢害，感情难以长久稳定。年上偏财透出，时上又见偏财，且无正财（正妻星）出现，主恋情多但难成正果，未婚可能性大，且感情多短暂。选项A符合此象。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "singapore_male_19930408_P004-Q19", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_0_g2\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4716, "response_id": "0bee55ab-4d86-4ab7-a163-ad1ead7849ec", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 227, "completion_tokens": 352, "total_tokens": 579, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 99}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "singapore_male_19930408_P004-Q20", "domain": "annual_fortune", "question": "命主抑郁症状最严重的年份？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字（癸酉、丙辰、己未、丙子），日主为己土，生于辰月，土旺得令，又有丙火生扶，身强。喜金水木，忌火土。\n\n抑郁症状通常与木（肝胆、情志）受克、水（肾、恐）受制或流年引发五行失衡有关。  \n- 2002年（壬午）：壬水正财透出，但午火为忌神，且午未合土，加重土性，木气被耗，情绪压抑，但壬水尚可调候，不算最严重。  \n- 2016年（丙申）：丙火忌神透干，但申金为喜用，且申子辰合水局，水旺可生木，情绪有出口，抑郁不重。  \n- 2018年（戊戌）：戊土劫财忌神，戌未辰三土成势，土重埋金，木气全无，且戌为火库，燥气加重，日主被厚土所困，情志极度压抑，此年抑郁症状最严重。  \n- 2024年（甲辰）：甲木正官为用，但辰土加重土性，且甲己合土，木被合化，虽有官星但被合绊，情绪不畅，但不如2018年土势之极。\n\n综上，2018年土旺无制，木气尽绝，为抑郁最严重年份。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "singapore_male_19930408_P004-Q20", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_0_g2\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4510, "response_id": "b440b0f8-c12e-4f1d-9aa6-5385c3e48ceb", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 208, "completion_tokens": 325, "total_tokens": 533, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 80}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
